{{- sc = scenario -}}
{{- p = sc.process -}}
{{- cast = sc.participants.size > 0 -}}
{{ banner "<!--" }} -->

# {{ md_cell sc.display_name }}

A scenario of [{{ md_cell p.display_name }}](../{{ kebab p.name }}.md).
