{{- end }}

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Name | {{ md_code sc.name }} |
| Starts at | {{ md_code sc.start.at }} |
{{- start = [] }}
{{- for kv in sc.start.context }}{{ start[start.size] = (md_code kv.key) + " = " + (md_code (json kv.value)) }}{{ end }}
{{- if start.size > 0 }}
| Start context | {{ start | array.join ", " }} |
{{- end }}
| Steps | {{ sc.steps.size }} |
| Outcome | {{ sc.outcome }} |
{{- if sc.participants.size > 0 }}

## Participants

Who acts: the value the team's system holds for them, the actor they stand for, what they hold, and the object that is their record.

| Participant | Identity | Stands for | Holds | Object |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{{- for pt in sc.participants }}
{{- holds = [] }}
{{- for h in pt.holds }}{{ holds[holds.size] = actor_link(h.actor, "../../") + (h.within ? " within " + (md_code h.within.name) : "") }}{{ end }}
| {{ md_code pt.name }}{{ if pt.display_name }} ({{ md_cell pt.display_name }}){{ end }} | {{ md_code ("" + pt.identity) }} | {{ pt.actor ? actor_link(pt.actor, "../../") : "" }} | {{ holds | array.join ", " }} | {{ pt.object ? (md_code pt.object.name) : "" }} |
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- with_states = false }}{{ for o in sc.objects }}{{ if o.states.size > 0 }}{{ with_states = true }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{- with_frozen = false }}{{ for o in sc.objects }}{{ if o.frozen }}{{ with_frozen = true }}{{ end }}{{ for l in o.links }}{{ if l.frozen }}{{ with_frozen = true }}{{ end }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{- if with_states || with_frozen }}

## Object states

The states objects are in, in lifecycles other than the one the scenario runs. A lifecycle not given takes the state the object's
bound value maps to, else its initial state.
{{- if with_frozen }} Frozen says whether the object, or a link of it, starts frozen: it can't be modified or deleted, and its links
can't be connected or disconnected, until a thaw.
{{- end }}

| Object | Entity | States |{{ if with_frozen }} Frozen |{{ end }}
| --- | --- | --- |{{ if with_frozen }} --- |{{ end }}
{{- for o in sc.objects }}
{{- frozen = [] }}{{ if o.frozen }}{{ frozen[frozen.size] = "yes" }}{{ end }}
{{- for l in o.links }}{{ if l.frozen }}{{ frozen[frozen.size] = "the link through " + (md_code l.end.name) + " to " + (md_code l.object.name) }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{- if o.states.size > 0 || frozen.size > 0 }}
{{- states = [] }}{{ for st in o.states }}{{ states[states.size] = md_code (st.path) }}{{ end }}
| {{ md_code o.name }} | {{ md_code o.entity.name }} | {{ states | array.join ", " }} |{{ if with_frozen }} {{ frozen | array.join ", " }} |{{ end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

## Walk-through

One row per step: who acts{{ if cast }} and the actor they act as{{ end }}, the input, whether the process accepts it, and the active states after it.

| Step |{{ if cast }} Participant |{{ end }} Actor | Input | Result | States after | Notes |
| --- |{{ if cast }} --- |{{ end }} --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{{- for st in sc.steps }}
{{- notes = [] }}
{{- if cast && st.participant && !st.acts_as && st.input != "verb" }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "matches no actor the step accepts" }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.signer }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "signer " + (md_code st.signer) + (st.meaning ? " as " + (md_code st.meaning.name) : "") }}{{ end }}
{{- if !st.signer && st.meaning }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "meaning " + (md_code st.meaning.name) }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.response != "sign" }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "response " + (md_code st.response) }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.signature }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "on signature " + (md_code st.signature.name) }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.reason }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "reason \"" + (md_cell st.reason) + "\"" }}{{ end }}
{{- for kv in st.payload }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "payload " + (md_code kv.key) + " = " + (md_code (json kv.value)) }}{{ end }}
{{- for kv in st.assume }}{{ if kv.value == "pass" || kv.value == "warning" || kv.value == "error" }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "check " + (md_code kv.key) + " assumed to " + (kv.value == "pass" ? "pass" : (kv.value == "warning" ? "warn" : "refuse")) }}{{ else }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "guard " + (md_code kv.key) + " assumed " + (kv.value ? "true" : "false") }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.expect }}{{ for tp in st.expect.check_warnings }}{{ warns = md_inline tp.message }}{{ if warns | string.ends_with "." }}{{ warns = string.slice warns 0 (warns.size - 1) }}{{ end }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "check " + (md_code tp.name) + " warns: " + warns }}{{ end }}{{ end }}

{{- if st.expect && st.expect.signatures.size > 0 }}{{ counted = [] }}{{ for c in st.expect.signatures }}{{ counted[counted.size] = (md_code c.signature.name) + " " + c.count }}{{ end }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "signatures counted after it: " + (counted | array.join ", ") }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.expect && st.expect.trigger_points.size > 0 }}{{ ran = [] }}{{ for tp in st.expect.trigger_points }}{{ ran[ran.size] = md_code tp.name }}{{ end }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "trigger points that ran: " + (ran | array.join ", ") }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.expect }}{{ for kv in st.expect.context }}{{ notes[notes.size] = (md_code kv.key) + " becomes " + (md_code (json kv.value)) }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.expect }}{{ for kv in st.expect.values }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "sets " + (md_code kv.key) + " to " + (md_code (json kv.value)) }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{- for kv in st.values }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "value " + (md_code kv.key) + " = " + (md_code (json kv.value)) }}{{ end }}
{{- for a in st.attributes }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "attribute " + (md_code a.name) }}{{ end }}
{{- if st.expect && st.expect.refused_by }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "refused by " + refuser(st.expect.refused_by, p) }}{{ else if st.expect && st.expect.refusal }}{{ notes[notes.size] = "refused: " + (md_code st.expect.refusal) }}{{ end }}
{{- input = st.input }}
{{- if st.input == "event" }}{{ input = "event " + (st.event ? (md_code st.event.name) : "`?`") }}
{{- else if st.input == "time" }}{{ input = "time passes: " + (md_code st.after) }}
{{- else if st.input == "invoke-done" }}{{ input = (st.invoke ? (md_code st.invoke.name) : "`?`") + " done" }}
{{- else if st.input == "invoke-error" }}{{ input = (st.invoke ? (md_code st.invoke.name) : "`?`") + " fails" }}
{{- else if st.input == "verb" }}{{ input = "does " + (st.verb ? (md_code st.verb.key) : "`?`") + (st.end ? " on the link through " + (md_code st.end.name) + (st.object ? " to " + (md_code st.object.name) : "") : "") }}{{ end }}
| {{ st.index + 1 }} |{{ if cast }} {{ st.participant ? (md_code st.participant.name) : "" }} |{{ end }} {{ (cast ? st.acts_as : st.actor) ? actor_link(cast ? st.acts_as : st.actor, "../../") : "" }} | {{ input }} | {{ !st.expect ? "not checked" : (st.expect.accepted ? "accepted" : "**refused**") }} | {{ st.expect ? code_paths(st.expect.states) : "" }} | {{ notes | array.join "; " }}{{ if st.description }}{{ notes.size > 0 ? ". " : "" }}{{ md_inline(st.description) }}{{ end }} |
{{- end }}

## Outcome

{{ sc.outcome == "final" ? "After the last step the process has reached a final state." : "After the last step the process is still active." }}
